  <Table>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sTitle"><Data ss:Type="String">Footnotes</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">a
'Code' indicates the source of data, as follows: C - Civil registration, estimated over 90% complete U - Civil registration, estimated less than 90% complete | - Other source, estimated reliable + - Data tabulated by date of registration rather than occurence ... - Information not available</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">*
Provisional. - Données provisoires.</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">italics
Data from civil registers which are incomplete or of unknown completeness.</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">1 The code is C. - Le code est C.</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">2 The code is U. - Le code est U.</Data></Cell>
      </Row>
      <Row>
        <Cell ss:StyleID="sLeft"><Data ss:Type="String">5 For 2019 and before, data on cause of death do not include a region. Therefore, rates must be used with caution. - Pour 2019 et avant, les données sur les causes de décès ne comprennent pas une région.</Data></Cell>
